{"study_accession":"PRJNA554845","secondary_study_accession":"SRP214806","title":"Construction of A Human Cell Landscape by Single-cell mRNA-seq","description":"We used single-cell RNA sequencing to determine the cell type composition of all major human organs and construct a basic scheme for the human cell landscape (HCL). We reveal a single-cell hierarchy for many tissues that have not been well characterized previously. We present a “single-cell HCL analysis’’ pipeline that accurately defines human cell types and exemplify its utility in stem cell biology. Finally, we perform single-cell comparative analysis of the human and mouse cell atlases to reveal the conserved genetic networks in the mammalian system. Overall design: Microwell-seq analyses of 60 types of human tissues and supplementary datasets for the Mouse Cell Atlas data.","pubmed":"32214235","geo_series":"","n_samples":14,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN12284776","study_accession":"PRJNA554845","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"Adult-Bone-Marrow1","description":"Adult-Bone-Marrow1","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM3943045","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-02-26","attributes":[["source_name","Microwell-seq analysis"],["age","60-year-old"],["sex","female"],["tissue","Bone Marrow"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR9693312","experiment_accession":"SRX6451586","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"HiSeq X Ten","read_count":39567629,"base_count":11949423958,"first_public":"2020-02-26","experiment_title":"HiSeq X Ten sequencing: GSM3943045: Adult-Bone-Marrow1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":true},{"sample_accession":"SAMN12429854","study_accession":"PRJNA554845","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-04-16